Make a copy of key(), and edit it.  Very near the end, in
the rectangles section, change
        border = F
to
        border = any(F, this$border)

Then
key(
       corner=c(1,1), text=c("1st option", "2nd option"),
       rectangle=list(size=5, angle=c(-45,45), density=10, border=T)
      )

Tim Hesterberg

