Well, why not just generate the bit patterns as you go, rather than
convert a number into a bit pattern?  You aren't actually using the
numbers except for loop indexing.  Something recursive like:

dobtop <- function(x, level)
{
    if(level == 0) { # x is complete
        if( {x meets certain conditions} )
                y <<- rbind(y, x)
    }
    else {
        for(i in 0:1) {
            x[level] <- i
            dobtop(x, level - 1)
        }
    }
}

level <- 28
y <- NULL
btopx <- rep(0, level)
dobtop(btopx, level)

